---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Kubernetes Operator"
  description="Manage Krabka clusters natively on Kubernetes with custom resource definitions."
  currentSlug="/docs/operator"
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">Kubernetes Operator</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2 text-base">
        Declarative cluster reconciliation, rolling upgrades, and automated partition rebalancing via <code class="text-krab-300 font-mono text-xs">krabka-operator</code>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
      <p>
        The operator reconciles resources in group <code class="font-mono text-krab-300 text-xs">krabka.io/v1alpha1</code> to manage cluster lifecycles, node pools, listener configurations, TLS certificates, and topic states.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
